<p>This is the inventory team's workspace. Manage the products your company stocks, and see stock levels and movement history.</p>

<div class="cards">
    <article>
        <h2>Products</h2>
        <p>Create and maintain products: SKU, name, unit and weight per unit. Deactivate products you no longer stock.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{$basePath}/modules/inventory/products">View products</a>
        
    </article>

    <article>
        <h2>Stock levels</h2>
        <p>See what is on hand, reserved and available for each product. Open a product to see its current stock.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{$basePath}/modules/inventory/products">Open a product</a>
    </article>

    <article>
        <h2>Movement history</h2>
        <p>Review every receipt and dispatch for a product, with opening and closing balances, oldest first.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{$basePath}/modules/inventory/products">Open a product</a>
    </article>

    <article>
        <h2>Reservations</h2>
        <p>Follow the stock held for submitted sales orders: active, released or dispatched, and the trip it left on.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{$basePath}/modules/inventory/reservations">View reservations</a>
    </article>
</div>
